<title>ARGENTINA: Telefonica de Argentina dividend.</title>
<headline>Telefonica de Argentina dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telefonica de Argentina said it will pay a cash dividend to its class A, B and C shareholders of 0.0544 pesos per share or $0.544 per ADS.</p>
<p>The dividend will be available for distribution from July 15 to all shareholders on record as of July 14, 1997, the company said in a news release.</p>
<p>((--Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
